            "explain": "The complete list of obstructions to null-cobordism in $\\Omega_*^{O}$ is the family of Stiefel–Whitney numbers $\\langle w_{i_1}\\smile\\cdots\\smile w_{i_r}(TM),[M]\\rangle$ ranging over all monomials of total degree $n$. They are simultaneously cobordism invariants and a complete invariant."
