            "explain": "Pairs $(a,b)$ with $\\gcd=1$, $\\max(|a|,|b|)\\le 2$, modulo sign: $[0:1],[1:0],[1:1],[1:-1],[1:2],[1:-2],[2:1],[2:-1],[1:0]$ already counted… enumeration gives $0,\\infty,\\pm 1,\\pm 2,\\pm 1/2$ — that's $11$ projective points."
