            "type": "mcq",
            "q": "The Hodge-to-de-Rham spectral sequence $E_1^{p,q} = H^q(X, \\Omega^p_X) \\Rightarrow H^{p+q}_{\\mathrm{dR}}(X)$ degenerates at $E_1$ for smooth projective $X/\\mathbb{C}$. What does this mean concretely?",
