            "answer": 1,
            "explain": "Sullivan: the rational homotopy category of simply-connected spaces of finite $\\mathbb{Q}$-type is equivalent to the homotopy category of minimal Sullivan models — free graded-commutative dgas $(\\Lambda V,d)$ with decomposable differential. The generators $V^n$ recover $\\pi_n(X)\\otimes\\mathbb{Q}$ dually."
