            "explain": "$\\Lambda(\\theta)=\\log\\mathbb{E}[e^{\\theta X}]=\\theta^2/2$. Maximising $\\theta x-\\theta^2/2$ in $\\theta$ gives $\\theta^*=x$ and $I(x)=x^2/2$. At $x=2$: $I(2)=2$."
