            "answer": 2,
            "explain": "Infinity posits a set $I$ with $\\emptyset \\in I$ and $x \\in I \\Rightarrow x \\cup \\{x\\} \\in I$. The intersection of all such $I$ is $\\omega$, the set of finite von Neumann ordinals."
